{"query": {"id": "20260628003006316861_f8a30d48", "handle": "q3", "text": 
"\"Ring of Nestor\" iconography interpretation Mycenaean", "importance": 
"core"}, "items": [{"id": "20260628003045075577_f6310e29", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "“This paper presents an analysis of the iconography surrounding the 
'Ring of Nestor' in the context of Aegean forgeries and authenticity debates. By
revisiting key iconographic features and comparisons, the paper aims to 
contribute to the ongoing discourse regarding the ring's significance in Minoan 
and Mycenaean art. Observations draw upon historical scholarship and recent 
discoveries to question and affirm previous conclusions related to the ring's 
