Gold Signet\x00d0rings and Bead\x00d0seals from Thisb\x00ea, 
Boeotia*.[9][10][20] Evans used the Homeric name "Nestor" to evoke the legendary
king of Pylos and the broader Mycenaean world, rather than to claim a direct 
